# ---------------------------------------------------------------- generated
# Both data folders are built from the official source files in this repo by
# `python build/build.py` and `python build/build_pcs.py`. They are large,
# they change wholesale on every rebuild, and nothing in them is authored --
# so they are rebuilt rather than committed. See README.md.
data/
data-pcs/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ archives
# The downloaded CMS/NCHS release archives. Their contents are already
# extracted into `Table and Index/` and `Code Descriptions/`, so keeping the
# zips as well would double 32 MB for nothing.
*.zip

# ------------------------------------------------- large human-reading PDFs
# The official releases ship each file twice: as XML/TXT, which the builds
# read, and as a PDF for a human to read. The PDFs come to about 126 MB and no
# build script opens one of them.
#
# `Guidelines/` is deliberately NOT ignored -- those three PDFs are the only
# source for the Official Guidelines text and `build/build_pcs.py` reads them.
Table and Index/*.pdf
Code Descriptions/*.pdf

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ scratch
# A clone of this same repository was made inside the project folder before it
# was set up in place. Nothing in it is needed.
ICD-Viewer/

# --------------------------------------------------------------- housekeeping
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
